   "origen": "Y Combinator Summer 2026",
   "pais": "Jaco, Puntarenas Province, Costa Rica",
   "contexto": "Host a Poker Club and Make Money. TL;DR: PokerClubHub is the first licensed poker club platform. We protect players’ deposits and allow anyone to open their own poker club and make money.\r\n\r\nRegulated online poker sites like PokerStars have open player pools and thus are full of pros and bots, driving players to unregulated private clubs.\r\n\r\nExisting poker club platforms like ClubGG have no payments processing. Players deposit with a club owner by sending them crypto for play-money chips. In theory, these chips can be exchanged back for money. However, players can get scammed and withdrawing takes ages.\r\n\r\nThis model is also broken for honest club owners who have to manually process hundreds of deposits a day. They lose out on rake when they sleep and struggle to get players to trust them.\r\n\r\nOn PokerClubhub, players deposit with PokerClubHub, not the club owner. We handle all deposits and withdrawals for the club owner, saving them time and increasing their earnings. We pay the rake (if any) to club owners as affiliate fees.\r\n\r\nWe hold the same gaming license as BetHog (built by founders of FanDuel) and Nexa Poker (part of World Poker Tour). Player deposits are secured using Fireblocks.\r\n\r\nYou can also play rake-f Ubicación: Jaco, Puntarenas Province, Costa Rica. Equipo: 0. Web: https://www.pokerclubhub.com",
